# Astro Conventions

## Component Frontmatter
```astro
---
// Always use TypeScript
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';
interface Props {
  post: CollectionEntry<'blog'>;
}
const { post } = Astro.props;
---
```

## Content Collections
- Define schemas in `src/content/config.ts` using Zod
- Access via `getCollection('blog')` / `getCollection('articles')`
- Filter drafts in production: `entry.data.draft !== true`

## Routing
- `src/pages/blog/[slug].astro` — dynamic routes from collection
- `src/pages/articles/[slug].astro` — dynamic routes from collection
- Use `getStaticPaths()` for all dynamic routes

## Layouts
- Single base layout: `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` with `<slot />`
- Props: `title`, `description` (for `<meta>`)
- Include `<link rel="canonical">` in every page

## Styling
- Scoped styles with `<style>` in component by default
- Global styles only in `src/styles/global.css`, imported in BaseLayout
- CSS custom properties for theme tokens (colors, spacing, typography)
- Mobile-first, clean typography — this is a reading-focused site

## Performance Rules
- `output: 'static'` in astro.config.mjs — always
- No client-side JS unless interactive component required
- Use `<Image>` from `astro:assets` for all `<img>` tags
- Inline critical CSS if possible; defer non-critical

## astro.config.mjs Baseline
```js
import { defineConfig } from 'astro/config';

export default defineConfig({
  site: 'https://sundev.pl',
  output: 'static',
  integrations: [],
});
```
